{
  "name": "[PA] 001 - Content Job Dispatcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pa/content-jobs",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pa001-webhook",
      "name": "DB Webhook (content_jobs)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "pa-content-jobs"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.record.status }}",
              "rightValue": "queued",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.old_record?.status ?? '' }}",
              "rightValue": "queued",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pa001-if-queued",
      "name": "queued로 바뀜?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-schedule",
      "name": "안전망: 1분마다",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/content_jobs?select=id&status=eq.queued&order=priority.desc,created_at.asc&limit=10",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-list-queued",
      "name": "queued Content Job 조회",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const id = $json.body?.record?.id ?? $json.id;\nif (!/^[0-9a-f-]{36}$/i.test(String(id || ''))) throw new Error(`invalid content job id: ${id}`);\nreturn { json: { content_job_id: id } };"
      },
      "id": "pa001-cj-id",
      "name": "Content Job ID 정리",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/claim_content_job",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ p_content_job_id: $json.content_job_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-claim",
      "name": "claim_content_job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// 선점에 성공한 Content Job (queued → generating). 0행이면 이 노드까지 오지 않는다.\n// 항상 prompt Job을 만든다. 프롬프트가 이미 있으면 WF-002가 LLM 없이 generation Job으로 넘긴다 (16.8 구현 메모).\nconst cj = $json;\nreturn { json: {\n  p_job_type: 'prompt',\n  p_persona_id: cj.persona_id,\n  p_content_job_id: cj.id,\n  p_worker: 'n8n',\n  p_payload: {},\n  p_priority: cj.priority,\n  p_max_attempts: 3,\n  p_idempotency_key: `prompt:${cj.id}:${cj.run_number}`\n} };"
      },
      "id": "pa001-prompt-params",
      "name": "prompt Job 준비",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/create_automation_job",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-create-prompt",
      "name": "create_automation_job (prompt)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/log_execution",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ p_job_id: $json.id, p_step: 'DISPATCH', p_service: 'n8n', p_status: 'succeeded', p_input: { workflow: 'WF-001', content_job_id: $json.content_job_id }, p_execution_ref: $execution.id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-log",
      "name": "실행 기록: DISPATCH",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "pending",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pa001-if-pending",
      "name": "새 prompt Job?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "return { json: { job_id: $json.id } };"
      },
      "id": "pa001-wf002-input",
      "name": "WF-002 입력",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1680,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WF002_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": false
        },
        "mode": "each"
      },
      "id": "pa001-exec-wf002",
      "name": "WF-002 실행",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/content_jobs?select=id,persona_id,priority,run_number&status=eq.generating&updated_at=lt.{{ encodeURIComponent($now.minus({ minutes: 5 }).toISO()) }}&order=updated_at.asc&limit=100",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-list-stuck",
      "name": "멈춘 generating Content Job 조회",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// 선점 후 prompt Job을 만들기 전에 실패한 Content Job 복구.\n// 같은 idempotency_key라 이미 Job이 있으면 기존 행이 돌아올 뿐 새로 생기지 않는다 (14.17).\nconst cj = $json;\nreturn { json: {\n  p_job_type: 'prompt',\n  p_persona_id: cj.persona_id,\n  p_content_job_id: cj.id,\n  p_worker: 'n8n',\n  p_payload: {},\n  p_priority: cj.priority,\n  p_max_attempts: 3,\n  p_idempotency_key: `prompt:${cj.id}:${cj.run_number}`\n} };"
      },
      "id": "pa001-recover-params",
      "name": "복구용 prompt Job 준비",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/create_automation_job",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "pa001-recover-create",
      "name": "create_automation_job (복구)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        480
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## [PA] 001 - Content Job Dispatcher (TECH 14.6)\n- 위: Supabase Database Webhook (`content_jobs` INSERT·UPDATE) → `queued`로 바뀐 Job만\n- 가운데: 1분마다 `queued` Content Job 10건 (놓친 Webhook)\n- 아래: 1분마다 5분 넘게 `generating`인 Content Job에 prompt Job이 있는지 확인 (선점 직후 실패 복구, 키가 같아 중복 없음). 새로 생긴 Job은 WF-002의 안전망이 가져간다\n\n`claim_content_job` → prompt Job 생성 (`prompt:{content_job_id}:{run_number}`) → WF-002 호출 (기다리지 않음)\n\n**import 후:** `YOUR-PROJECT-REF` 치환, `WF-002 실행` 노드에서 `[PA] 002 - Prompt Generator` 선택\nCredential: Webhook → `PA Webhook Secret`, Supabase 노드 → `PA Supabase`\nSettings → Error Workflow: `[PA] 006 - Error Handler`",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "pa001-note",
      "name": "메모",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -500
      ]
    }
  ],
